@HostAddress = http://localhost:5073

### 1. Health Check
GET {{HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create Account - Success (AC1)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student_demo@campus.edu",
  "password": "SecurePassword@2026",
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "role": "Student",
  "phoneNumber": "0912345678",
  "studentCode": "B26DCCN001"
}

### 3. Create Account - Validation Failure (AC2: Invalid email & short password)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "123",
  "fullName": "",
  "role": "InvalidRole"
}

### 4. Get All Accounts
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Account By ID
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts/mock_admin_01
Accept: application/json

### 6. Update Account Information (AC3)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts/mock_student_04
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van An Updated",
  "phoneNumber": "0987654321",
  "avatarUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/campus/avatar.png",
  "role": "Student"
}

### 7. Update Non-Existent Account (AC4: 404 Not Found)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts/non_existent_account_99999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nobody"
}

### 8. Lock Account (AC 35.1.1)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts/mock_student_04/lock
Accept: application/json

### 9. Unlock Account (AC 35.1.2)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts/mock_student_04/unlock
Accept: application/json

### 10. Lock Non-Existent Account (AC 35.1.3: 404 Not Found)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts/non_existent_account_99999/lock
Accept: application/json

### 11. Toggle Account Status
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts/mock_student_04/toggle-status
Accept: application/json

### 12. Login - Active Account (Success: 200 OK)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@campus.edu",
  "password": "Admin@123456"
}

### 13. Login - Locked Account (AC 35.1.5: 403 Forbidden)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "locked_student@campus.edu",
  "password": "Student@123456"
}

### 14. Login - Invalid Credentials (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@campus.edu",
  "password": "WrongPassword!"
}
